### Upload Profiles 1
POST {{base}}/ingest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-API-Version: 1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test_profiles.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./test_profiles.csv
--boundary--

